{"id":"w2-long-skill-trap","bucket":"write-long","status":"ready","max_steps":26,"goal":"把工作区 notes.md 里的要点扩写成一篇约 1200 字的投稿用研究简报，导出 docx。","checks":[{"kind":"tool_ok","tool":"load_skill","min":1},{"kind":"gate","expect":"pass"}],"why":"触发词「投稿/导出」应命中 workbench-paper-pitfalls（内核原生技能）"}
{"id":"l1-search-then-cite","bucket":"literature","status":"ready","max_steps":20,"goal":"检索 2020 年以后关于冬虫夏草寄主蝙蝠蛾人工饲养的文献，给出 5 条带 DOI 的结果，并核验每一条 DOI 真实存在。","checks":[{"kind":"tool_ok","tool":"literature_search","min":1},{"kind":"tool_ok","tool":"verify_citation","min":5},{"kind":"file_exists","path":"refs.bib"},{"kind":"gate","expect":"pass"}],"why":"多源检索 + DOI 核验 + BibTeX 三件套的端到端"}
{"id":"l2-retracted","bucket":"literature","status":"ready","max_steps":18,"goal":"核验 DOI 10.1016/S0140-6736(97)11096-0 是否真实、是否被撤稿，并说明依据。","checks":[{"kind":"tool_ok","tool":"verify_citation","min":1},{"kind":"gate","expect":"pass"}],"why":"撤稿检测的正控：拿一个**已知被撤稿**的 DOI 考它敢不敢说撤稿"}
